deedglass health pilot  synthetic data · about 15 minutes to read

  pack   india-health 1.0.0, enforced; PHI mode on; lockdown on
  store  an in-memory FHIR R4 store inside this binary: synthetic records only
         nothing leaves this machine
  agent  pilot-agent, labelled connector=ehr
  rules  decided now by the policy engine deedglass serve runs; writes go
         through the FHIR connector's own code and are read back

1/4  An agent writes a record, and the read-back matches
     request  ehr.create Observation: heart rate 72 /min,
              Patient/pat-synthetic-1
     rule     ◐ waits for a person: lockdown.write-needs-person
                india-health allowed it (verify-levels, Checked (L1)); lockdown
                makes every write wait
     approve  ✓ countersigned by pilot-owner@example.test, the pilot's stand-in
                admin; on your server a named person does this
     server   201 Created · Observation/1001 version 1
     check    ✓ Checked · Matches: 6 fields read back at version 1

2/4  "201 Created", but the stored value differs
     The synthetic store is set to change one value as it saves it, as a faulty
     interface mapping might.
     request  ehr.create Observation: body temperature 38.4 Cel,
              Patient/pat-synthetic-1
     rule     ◐ waits for a person: lockdown.write-needs-person
                india-health allowed it (verify-levels, Checked (L1)); lockdown
                makes every write wait
     approve  ✓ countersigned by pilot-owner@example.test, the pilot's stand-in
                admin; on your server a named person does this
     server   201 Created · Observation/1002 version 1
     check    ✕ Checked · Doesn't match: the server answered 201, but stored
                something else
                valueQuantity.value  sent 38.4, stored 37.4

3/4  A high-risk write waits for a person
     request  ehr.create Claim: a pre-authorisation of INR 1,20,000 (synthetic)
     rule     ◐ waits for a person: preauth-large-two-people
                Pre-authorisations of INR 1,00,000 or more need two people,
                within the hour. Two admins approve in Console › Approvals.
     who      2 different people from role:admin (four-eyes)
              expires in 15 minutes; timeout means no (lockdown)
     app      on a server the approvers open it in the Deedglass app
              see the app on this computer: deedglass app
     result   Nothing reached the record system. It runs only after a person
              approves.

4/4  Seal the records and check them offline
     records  2 sealed with sk_01m58nq2…, a key made for this run
              the held write is sealed when a person decides or it expires
     verify   ✓ 2 deeds, chain intact, 1 seal key
     tamper   one byte changed in deed 1
     verify   ✕ Deed 1 was changed after it was sealed.
     files    deeds.jsonl and keys.json in deedglass-pilot; check them yourself
              there with: deedglass verify deeds.jsonl --keys keys.json

✓ Pilot complete. 4 scenes on synthetic data.
  report  deedglass-pilot/REPORT.md, ready to forward
  review  deedglass-pilot/IT_REVIEW_PACK.md, for your security review

